{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52960","headline":"江州卧疾送李侍御歌（题拟） · 李华","name":"江州卧疾送李侍御歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江沉沉兮雨凄凄，洲渚没兮玄云低，伤别心兮闻鼓鼙。\n（见《文苑英华》卷七二○李华《江州卧疾送李侍御序》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}